<title>HONG KONG: Datang Power debuts at HK$3.00/share.</title>
<headline>Datang Power debuts at HK$3.00/share.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of power play Beijing Datang Power Generation Co Ltd made their trading debut at HK$3.00 per share, compared with their issue price of HK$2.52 each.</p>
</text>
